", "stepway", "sandero", "lodgy"], "long_description": "D\u00e9couvrez les v\u00e9hicules Dacia, en 3D. Sandero Stepway, Lodgy Stepway, Nouveau Duster, Dokker Stepway, Logan et Logan MCV. D\u00e9couvrez leur design et installez-vous \u00e0 l'int\u00e9rieur pour d\u00e9couvrir leurs habitacles comme si vous y \u00e9tiez. \nApplication \u00e0 vocation de divertissement, dont les visuels non contractuels, sont une illustration de la gamme Dacia, qui ne remplace pas les configurateurs ou brochures commerciales, et n' engagent pas Dacia sur l\u2019\u00e9quipement des v\u00e9hicules commercialis\u00e9s dans le r\u00e9seau de distribution.", "short_description": "D\u00e9couvrez les v\u00e9hicules Dacia, en 3D"}]}, "developer_name": "SERIOUS FACTORY", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dacia.fr/cookies.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.dacia.fr/cookies.html", "publisher_name": "RENAULT", "support_website_url": "http://www.dacia.fr/", "website_url": "http://www.dacia.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PRODUCTIVITY", "UTILITY", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1104405853465732"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974672_744015079315393_4569445491812597760_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EgC1oa-mSVAQ7kNvwEyWkpc&_nc_oc=AdmaCXQ68H_5TnZRk-Q0c3ZP0wpUZaYrT7LtMcG0ixvdRcdhP0-vWBMs5qZtL-Bs8_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.ocu